keywords:
  - "coding agents"
  - "agent harness"
  - "state machine"
  - "meta-harness"
  - "harness2"
  - "recursive harness evolution"
  - "context engineering"
  - "prompt caching"
  - "software engineering"
abstract: >-
  Vi-Harness is an enterprise-grade, model-agnostic agent harness and evidence-gated recursive
  evolution runtime designed to investigate and optimize coding-agent performance across
  8 modular harness components, context compilation, progressive compaction, verification gating,
  formal LTLf & invariant verification, and state-machine control.
